The following issues require manual code changes:
  ./service.go:25:16: connect.Client is not generic in connectrpc.com/connect/v2, which replaced the v1 import. Port it by hand.
  ./service.go:26:9: connect.NewClient is not generic in connectrpc.com/connect/v2, which replaced the v1 import. Port it by hand.
  ./service.go:31:7: connect.Codec has a different method set in connectrpc.com/connect/v2, which replaced the v1 import. Port implementations by hand.
  ./service.go:39:7: connect.Compressor has a different method set in connectrpc.com/connect/v2, which replaced the v1 import. Port implementations by hand.

